-names></name><name><surname>Norton</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Demographic factors that influence human disc cell proliferation in vitro</article-title><source>The Spine Journal</source><volume>6</volume><fpage>120</fpage><lpage>124</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16517381</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gruber</surname><given-names>HE</given-names></name><name><surname>Norton</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Leslie</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Clinical and demographic prognostic indicators for human disc cell proliferation in vitro: A pilot study</article-title><source>Spine</source><volume>26</volume><fpage>2323</fpage><lpage>2327</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11679816</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b11-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="confproc"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gustavson</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Tedeschi</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Camp</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>AQUA&#x02122; based analysis of thymidylate synthase (TS) within subcellular compartments reveals a novel biomarker for prediction of compartments reveals a novel biomarker for prediction of survival in colorectal carcinomas</article-title><conf-name>First AACR Internatl. Conf. on Molecular Diagnostics in Cancer Therapeutic Devel</conf-name><conf-date>Sept., 12&#x02013;15, 2006</conf-date><comment>abstract</comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b12-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hanley</surname><given-names>EN</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>David</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Lumbar arthrodesis for the treatment of back pain</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Amer</source><volume>81A</volume><fpage>716</fpage><lpage>730</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10360702</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b13-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johannessen</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Auerback</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Wheaton</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Non-invasive determination of nucleus. pulposus proteoglycan content using T<sub>1&#x003c1;</sub> MRI</article-title><source>Eur Cells Materials</source><volume>10</volume><fpage>31</fpage><comment>abstract</comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b14-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Katz</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Lumbar disc disorders and low-back pain: Socioeconomic factors and consequences</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg [Am]</source><volume>88A</volume><issue>Suppl 2</issue><fpage>21</fpage><lpage>24</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b15-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Laterza</surname><given-names>OF</given-names></name><name><surname>Modur</surname><given-names>VR</given-names></name><name><surname>Crimmins</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Identification of novel brain biomarkers</article-title><source>Clin Chem</source><volume>52</volume><fpage>1713</fpage><lpage>1721</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16858073</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b16-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="web"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liszewski</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Biomarker detection &#x00026; measurement. Harnessing useful diagnostic therapeutic information</article-title><source>Genetic Engineering News</source><comment>URL: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.historx.com/news/GEN%203.15.06.pdf">http://www.historx.com/news/GEN%203.15.06.pdf</ext-link></comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b17-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Majumdar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Blumenkrantz</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Keshari</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Recent advances in MRI markers of disc. degeneration</article-title><source>Eur Cells Materials</source><volume>10</volume><fpage>30</fpage><comment>abstract</comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b18-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maroudas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Ghosh</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><year>1988</year><article-title>Nutrition and metabolism of the intervertebral disc</article-title><source>The Biology of the Intervertebral Disc</source><volume>II </volume><publisher-name>CRC Press, Inc</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Boca Raton, Fl</publisher-loc><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>37</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b19-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Poole</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Biologic markers and disc degeneration</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg [Am]</source><volume>88A</volume><issue>Suppl 2</issue><fpage>72</fpage><lpage>75</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b20-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rifa</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerszten</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Biomarker discovery and validation</article-title><source>Clin Chem</source><volume>52</volume><fpage>1635</fpage><lpage>1637</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16940460</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b21-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Taylor</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Twomey</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Ghosh</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><year>1988</year><article-title>The development of the human intervertebral disc</article-title><source>The Biology of the Intervertebral Disc</source><volume>I </volume><publisher-name>CRC Press, Inc</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Boca Raton, Fl</publisher-loc><fpage>39</fpage><lpage>82</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b22-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Pearce</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name><name><surname>Schechter</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1990</year><article-title>Preliminary evaluation of a scheme for grading the gross morphology of the human intervertebral disc</article-title><source>Spine</source><volume>15</volume><fpage>411</fpage><lpage>415</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2363069</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b23-bmi-2006-131"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Y&#x000fc;ceer</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Arasil</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Temiz</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Serum immunoglobulins in brain tumors and lumbar disc disease</article-title><source>Neuro Report</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>279</fpage><lpage>281</lpage></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>